  <h1>Room Status</h1>
  <p class="lede">The room board of the shift, on a phone or the desk screen: every room by floor with its housekeeping code, DND, VIP and arrival flags, its attendant and a note. A tap changes it, and every change is kept with its time. The board shows the next room to clean, the rooms ready for today's arrivals, what is out of order, and how long a room takes from check-out to clean and from clean to inspected.</p>
